	<x:String x:Key="TourGridText">Edit values row by row. Right-click for copy, paste, duplicate and delete.</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourAddRowTitle">Add a row</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourAddRowText">Append a new empty row to the data grid.</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourHistoryTitle">Undo history</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourHistoryText">See every past edit as a timeline and jump straight back to any point, not just one step at a time.</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourSearchTitle">Search</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourSearchText">Highlights matching text across all columns as you type.</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourFilterTitle">Filter</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourFilterText">Toggle this to hide every row that doesn't match your search instead of just highlighting them.</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourReplaceTitle">Find &amp; Replace</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourReplaceText">Replace matching values across the whole table, one at a time or all at once.</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourSwitchJsonTitle">Table / JSON view</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourSwitchJsonText">Switch to the raw JSON editor and back at any time.</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourJsonEditorTitle">Raw JSON editor</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourJsonEditorText">A full text editor with JSON syntax highlighting and line numbers, kept in sync with the table.</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourJsonFormatTitle">Prettify &amp; minify</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourJsonFormatText">Format the JSON with indentation, or collapse it to a single line.</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourJsonFindTitle">Find &amp; replace</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourJsonFindText">Search the JSON with Ctrl+F, or replace with Ctrl+H. Press the same shortcut again to close the panel.</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourSwitchTableTitle">Back to the table</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourSwitchTableText">Your JSON edits are applied when you switch back to the table view.</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourFileExplorerTitle">File explorer</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourFileExplorerText">Toggle the side panel to browse and open files from disk. Let's open it.</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourExplorerPanelTitle">File browser</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourExplorerPanelText">Browse a folder as a tree: open files into tabs, and use search to filter them. Right-click any item for new / rename / delete, and drag &amp; drop to move.</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourExplorerOpenTitle">Open a folder</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourExplorerOpenText">Pick a working folder here to populate the tree. The header buttons also refresh, collapse and create files.</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourRecentFoldersTitle">Recent folders</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourRecentFoldersText">Once you've opened a folder, this lists your last 5 for quick access.</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourNotificationsTitle">Notifications</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourNotificationsText">Open the notification center to review recent messages and events.</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourThemeTitle">Light / dark theme</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourThemeText">Switch between light and dark appearance.</x:String>
	<x:String x:Key="TourLanguageTitle">Language</x:String>
